#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0086.1 expect=noViolation domain=BW
#note "The conformant shape: row 1's examination was not done and no result is presented, so the sheet Rule ('--ORRES = null') is satisfied; row 2 carries a result and no status. Silent BEFORE and AFTER M3-D2 -- before, because the dead backtick guard suppressed everything; after, because --ORRES is empty on the only NOT DONE row. Its invalid sibling is what discriminates."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset BW class=FINDINGS label="Body Weight"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col BWSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col BWTESTCD type=Char label="Test Short Name"
col BWORRES  type=Char label="Result or Finding in Original Units"
col BWSTAT   type=Char label="Completion Status"
---
S1 | BW | 001 | 1 | BW |       | NOT DONE
S1 | BW | 001 | 2 | BW | 185.1 |
---
